#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:43
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A match was found: ask the person whether the requirements go on #NNN, then link the work there. The issue is where stakeholders sign off, so no phase proceeds without one."
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:15
#. Diagram label
msgid "Agent"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:38
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Ask — never create. Creating an issue without the BA's permission is the thing this step exists to prevent."
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:36
#. Diagram label
msgid "Ask BA to create or link issue"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:10
#. Diagram label
msgid "CRDM — link the work to an issue"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:13
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Feature work must be linked to a GitHub issue. First find the related work (beans, issues, open PRs) and ask whether to coordinate; then scan before creating, and never create one without the BA's permission — an issue is the stakeholder's record, not the agent's scratchpad."
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:35
#. Diagram label
msgid "Issue found?"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:42
#. Diagram label
msgid "Link to existing issue"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:50
#. Diagram label
msgid "no"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:26
#. Diagram label
msgid "Phase begins"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:46
#. Diagram label
msgid "Phase complete"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:27
#. Diagram label
msgid "Related work: find, sort, ask"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:30
#. Diagram label
msgid "Scan open issues for match"
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:32
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Search open issues, then recently closed ones, by title and body keywords for one this request belongs to. Requirements may span several issues; note every relevant one."
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:16
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The only CRDM sub-diagram in this slice where the BA has no lane of its own: A_AskCreate is still an Agent-lane activity, so the permission this process exists to enforce is obtained out of band rather than modelled as a cross-lane handoff, unlike crdm-requirements-definition.bpmn and crdm-close.bpmn elsewhere in the same methodology."
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:28
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "When the requirement is initiated or updated through a human-agent chat, search the beans and the repository's issues and open PRs for relevance, categorize and summarize them, and ask the user whether and how to coordinate. Judgement decides the categories; the user decides the coordination. Owner, 2026-09-23 (issue #1023)."
msgstr ""

#: processes/crdm-issue-linking.bpmn:51
#. Diagram label
msgid "yes"
msgstr ""
